{"audio": "john-15.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 187333, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 2533, "text": "John, Chapter Fifteen."}, {"start_ms": 2533, "end_ms": 5600, "text": "I am the true vine, and my Father is the husbandman."}, {"start_ms": 5600, "end_ms": 13867, "text": "Every branch in me that beareth not fruit he taketh away: and every branch that beareth fruit, he purgeth it, that it may bring forth more fruit."}, {"start_ms": 13867, "end_ms": 17733, "text": "Now ye are clean through the word which I have spoken unto you."}, {"start_ms": 17733, "end_ms": 20000, "text": "Abide in me, and I in you."}, {"start_ms": 20000, "end_ms": 27333, "text": "As the branch cannot bear fruit of itself, except it abide in the vine; no more can ye, except ye abide in me."}, {"start_ms": 27333, "end_ms": 36533, "text": "I am the vine, ye are the branches: He that abideth in me, and I in him, the same bringeth forth much fruit: for without me ye can do nothing."}, {"start_ms": 36533, "end_ms": 44400, "text": "If a man abide not in me, he is cast forth as a branch, and is withered; and men gather them, and cast them into the fire, and they are burned."}, {"start_ms": 44400, "end_ms": 51467, "text": "If ye abide in me, and my words abide in you, ye shall ask what ye will, and it shall be done unto you."}, {"start_ms": 51467, "end_ms": 57200, "text": "Herein is my Father glorified, that ye bear much fruit; so shall ye be my disciples."}, {"start_ms": 57200, "end_ms": 62533, "text": "As the Father hath loved me, so have I loved you: continue ye in my love."}, {"start_ms": 62533, "end_ms": 70933, "text": "If ye keep my commandments, ye shall abide in my love; even as I have kept my Father's commandments, and abide in his love."}, {"start_ms": 70933, "end_ms": 76800, "text": "These things have I spoken unto you, that my joy might remain in you, and that your joy might be full."}, {"start_ms": 76800, "end_ms": 81200, "text": "This is my commandment, That ye love one another, as I have loved you."}, {"start_ms": 81200, "end_ms": 86133, "text": "Greater love hath no man than this, that a man lay down his life for his friends."}, {"start_ms": 86133, "end_ms": 89467, "text": "Ye are my friends, if ye do whatsoever I command you."}, {"start_ms": 89467, "end_ms": 100000, "text": "Henceforth I call you not servants; for the servant knoweth not what his lord doeth: but I have called you friends; for all things that I have heard of my Father I have made known unto you."}, {"start_ms": 100000, "end_ms": 112267, "text": "Ye have not chosen me, but I have chosen you, and ordained you, that ye should go and bring forth fruit, and that your fruit should remain: that whatsoever ye shall ask of the Father in my name, he may give it you."}, {"start_ms": 112267, "end_ms": 116133, "text": "These things I command you, that ye love one another."}, {"start_ms": 116133, "end_ms": 121067, "text": "If the world hate you, ye know that it hated me before it hated you."}, {"start_ms": 121067, "end_ms": 130000, "text": "If ye were of the world, the world would love his own: but because ye are not of the world, but I have chosen you out of the world, therefore the world hateth you."}, {"start_ms": 130000, "end_ms": 134933, "text": "Remember the word that I said unto you, The servant is not greater than his lord."}, {"start_ms": 134933, "end_ms": 141467, "text": "If they have persecuted me, they will also persecute you; if they have kept my saying, they will keep yours also."}, {"start_ms": 141467, "end_ms": 147333, "text": "But all these things will they do unto you for my name's sake, because they know not him that sent me."}, {"start_ms": 147333, "end_ms": 154933, "text": "If I had not come and spoken unto them, they had not had sin: but now they have no cloke for their sin."}, {"start_ms": 154933, "end_ms": 157867, "text": "He that hateth me hateth my Father also."}, {"start_ms": 157867, "end_ms": 167200, "text": "If I had not done among them the works which none other man did, they had not had sin: but now have they both seen and hated both me and my Father."}, {"start_ms": 167200, "end_ms": 173867, "text": "But this cometh to pass, that the word might be fulfilled that is written in their law, They hated me without a cause."}, {"start_ms": 173867, "end_ms": 187333, "text": "But when the Comforter is come, whom I will send unto you from the Father, even the Spirit of truth, which proceedeth from the Father, he shall testify of me: And ye also shall bear witness, because ye have been with me from the beginning."}], "words": [{"t": "John,", "s": 945, "e": 1246, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 1387, "e": 1789, "si": 0}, {"t": "Fifteen.", "s": 1890, "e": 2473, "si": 0}, {"t": "I", "s": 2954, "e": 2974, "si": 1}, {"t": "am", "s": 3014, "e": 3074, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 3114, "e": 3174, "si": 1}, {"t": "true", "s": 3235, "e": 3455, "si": 1}, {"t": "vine,", "s": 3515, "e": 3876, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 3916, "e": 3996, "si": 1}, {"t": "my", "s": 4016, "e": 4137, "si": 1}, {"t": "Father", "s": 4217, "e": 4558, "si": 1}, {"t": "is", "s": 4618, "e": 4718, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 4758, "e": 4838, "si": 1}, {"t": "husbandman.", "s": 4878, "e": 5420, "si": 1}, {"t": "Every", "s": 6160, "e": 6361, "si": 2}, {"t": "branch", "s": 6481, "e": 6821, "si": 2}, {"t": "in", "s": 6861, "e": 6941, "si": 2}, {"t": "me", "s": 7001, "e": 7081, "si": 2}, {"t": "that", "s": 7181, "e": 7301, "si": 2}, {"t": "beareth", "s": 7341, "e": 7642, "si": 2}, {"t": "not", "s": 7702, "e": 7862, "si": 2}, {"t": "fruit", "s": 7942, "e": 8222, "si": 2}, {"t": "he", "s": 8282, "e": 8342, "si": 2}, {"t": "taketh", "s": 8422, "e": 8743, "si": 2}, {"t": "away:", "s": 8783, "e": 9083, "si": 2}, {"t": "and", "s": 9703, "e": 9804, "si": 2}, {"t": "every", "s": 9844, "e": 10024, "si": 2}, {"t": "branch", "s": 10084, "e": 10424, "si": 2}, {"t": "that", "s": 10464, "e": 10584, "si": 2}, {"t": "beareth", "s": 10624, "e": 10925, "si": 2}, {"t": "fruit,", "s"